<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Reset Successful</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 32px 24px;
            color: #334155;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .alert-box {
            margin: 24px 0;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background-color: #f0fdf4;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            color: #166534;
        }
        .alert-box strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .meta-list {
            margin: 16px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .warning-text {
            color: #dc2626;
            font-size: 13px;
            background-color: #fef2f2;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Housing Platform Security</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

            <div class="alert-box">
                <strong>Password Successfully Changed</strong>
                Your account password was updated successfully. All previous active sessions have been terminated.
            </div>

            <ul class="meta-list">
                <li><strong>Time of Change:</strong> <%= resetTime %></li>
                <% if (ipAddress) { %>
                    <li><strong>Request IP:</strong> <%= ipAddress %></li>
                <% } %>
            </ul>

            <div class="warning-text">
                <strong>Didn't make this request?</strong><br>
                If you did not perform this password change, your credentials may have been compromised. Please contact platform administrators or support immediately to secure your account.
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Housing & Roommate Management System. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>